From 42a35b28964b775edab9d4683685ac1533b2ed8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FrankX3M <you@example.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 16:47:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: vpn-panel.service PATH excludes /usr/bin, breaks sudo
 lookup for control()
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Environment="PATH=.../.venv/bin" fully replaced the process PATH instead of
extending it. core/svc/control.py calls subprocess.run(["sudo", "systemctl",
...]) without shell=True, so the command is resolved via PATH lookup — with
only .venv/bin on PATH, 'sudo' (in /usr/bin) isn't found:

  ServiceControlError trace -> FileNotFoundError:
  [Errno 2] No such file or directory: 'sudo'

Reproduced on POST /api/users -> apply() -> control("sing-box", "reload").

Also documented inline that WorkingDirectory/PATH/ExecStart must all use the
same real deploy path (a recurring source of status=203/EXEC in this deploy).
---
 deploy/systemd/vpn-panel.service | 12 +++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/deploy/systemd/vpn-panel.service b/deploy/systemd/vpn-panel.service
index 1c93e21..1caa269 100644
--- a/deploy/systemd/vpn-panel.service
+++ b/deploy/systemd/vpn-panel.service
@@ -7,13 +7,23 @@ Type=simple
 User=vpn-panel
 Group=vpn-panel
 WorkingDirectory=/opt/vpn-panel
-Environment="PATH=/opt/vpn-panel/.venv/bin"
+Environment="PATH=/opt/vpn-panel/.venv/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin"
 ExecStart=/opt/vpn-panel/.venv/bin/uvicorn src.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
 Restart=on-failure
 RestartSec=3
 
 # Панель слушает только localhost — наружу её отдаёт Caddy (reverse_proxy + basicauth),
 # см. contracts/04_render_caddy.md и architecture.md, раздел 4.
+#
+# PATH явно включает /usr/bin и /usr/sbin в дополнение к venv: core/svc/control.py
+# (контракт 05_service_control) вызывает subprocess.run(["sudo", "systemctl", ...])
+# без shell=True — команда ищется строго по PATH процесса, и если PATH содержит
+# только venv/bin, sudo (лежит в /usr/bin) не находится:
+# "[Errno 2] No such file or directory: 'sudo'".
+#
+# ВАЖНО: если реальный путь деплоя отличается от /opt/vpn-panel (например,
+# /opt/vpn_panel_test) — замени во ВСЕХ трёх местах (WorkingDirectory, PATH,
+# ExecStart), иначе получишь status=203/EXEC при старте юнита.
 
 [Install]
 WantedBy=multi-user.target
-- 
